  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 809.01 Form DP-3R, Notice of Real Estate Transfer Tax Refunded. Within 15 business days following the end of the month in which the department refunds transfer tax on a recorded transfer, the department shall submit Form DP-3R, “Notice of Real Estate Transfer Tax Refunded” to the register of deeds of the county in which the property transferred is located.\n\nSource. #6691, eff 2-21-98, EXPIRED: 2-21-06\n\nNew. #8579, eff 3-8-06; ss by #10665, eff 9-9-14; ss by 14071, eff 9-10-24",
